Z||000000||Dale||10-06-1999||02:03 PM||||Well, thats what my wife calls it anyway.<P>OK!  it's an 84 se 4cyl. At idle and when you barely touch the gas the car wants to, yes, lurch.  It feels like the timing is very far advanced and missing.  If I back off on the timing a lot it goes away and so does all the power to a point where it bogs when giving gas.  I have replaced the TPS and the MAP sensor.  Is it posible that it could be the idle circut.  This has been a puzzling thing for a long time now to a point where I havn't driven the car much lately.<P>Any ideas?<BR>Mahalo ||||reg||5
